  "input": "Which note first recorded that webhooks depends on the event-bus, and when?\n[2025-06-19] standup/boreal/2025-06-19: As before, webhooks needs the event-bus to work. [2025-02-11] standup/boreal/2025-02-11-2: If the bus is down, the webhooks service is down: it relies on it for outbound events. [2025-01-09] standup/boreal/2025-01-09-3: For the record, the webhook dispatcher is owned by team Boreal.",
